{"id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per.md","title":"依赖对类型的成员 PER 候选","display":"df-dependent-pair-membership-per — 依赖对类型的成员 PER 候选","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per","aliases":["72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per"],"display":"df-dependent-pair-membership-per — 依赖对类型的成员 PER 候选","depends_on":["[[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.8 dependent product, print743–744/PDF755–756; local PER encoding extending §3.9","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source dependent-pair interface and typed relation construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-pair-membership-per — 依赖对类型的成员 PER 候选"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c65f237e17c892c\" href=\"?note=5c65f237e17c892c\" title=\"72-df-per-cartesian-product\">72-df-per-cartesian-product</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.8 dependent product, print743–744/PDF755–756; local PER encoding extending §3.9"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source dependent-pair interface and typed relation construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{pair}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{pair}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c65f237e17c892c\" href=\"?note=5c65f237e17c892c\" title=\"72-df-per-cartesian-product\">72-df-per-cartesian-product</a> 的惰性单射对构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;)\">\\(a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\">\\(a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,b&#39;\\in T\">\\(b,b&#39;\\in T\\)</span>；预求值扩张取同一结构。下式定义 Q 与依赖对关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\rangle:\na\\alpha a&#39;\\land\\langle b,b&#39;\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\rangle:\na\\alpha a&#39;\\land\\langle b,b&#39;\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二分量的关系随第一分量的等价类变化；纤维在 α 类上相同保证两种第一分量代表得到同一关系。若 Φ 恒为 β，这一构造退化为现有笛卡尔积 PER，下一条给出正式等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-per-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-per-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{pair}$ 采用 [[72-df-per-cartesian-product]] 的惰性单射对构造。$\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，$\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，且 $a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')","display":false},{"tex":"a,a'\\in|\\alpha|","display":false},{"tex":"b,b'\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a',b')\\rangle:\na\\alpha a'\\land\\langle b,b'\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.","display":true}],"bytes":1732,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-558","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-553","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-553","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-funct